{"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Workflows","title":"Workflows","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftWorkflow\/documentation\/SwiftWorkflow\/PCAClassificationWorkflow"]},{"anchor":"Articles","title":"Articles","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftWorkflow\/documentation\/SwiftWorkflow\/WorkflowPersistence"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiftWorkflow"},{"type":"text","text":" provides immutable, production-grade pipelines that compose missing-value imputation, feature scaling, dimensionality reduction, and classification into single deployable units."}]},{"anchor":"Key-Capabilities","level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Key Capabilities"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Fitted End-to-End Pipeline"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": ","type":"text"},{"code":"PCAClassificationWorkflow","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" integrating mean imputation, standard scaling, SVD-based PCA projection, and binary logistic regression.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Strict Row Provenance"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": ","type":"text"},{"code":"Predictions","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" preserving ","type":"text"},{"code":"sourceRowIndices","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" directly from the input ","type":"text"},{"code":"PreparedSupervisedBatch","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"PreparedNumericBatch","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" across non-contiguous batch selections.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Training-Only Fitting"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Fitted state is computed solely on the designated training batch, preventing data leakage from test or validation sets.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Atomic JSON Serialization"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Lightweight, versioned JSON serialization (","type":"text"},{"code":"save(to:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"load(from:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") enabling cross-process persistence and cold-start inference without retaining raw datasets.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Example-Usage","level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Example Usage"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import Foundation","import SwiftDataFrame","import SwiftWorkflow","","\/\/ 1. Prepare supervised numeric batch","let batch = try rawDF.prepareNumericBatch([\"signal\", \"companion\", \"noise\", \"target\"])","let supervised = try PreparedSupervisedBatch(batch, targetColumn: \"target\")","","\/\/ 2. Train workflow strictly on training partition","let trainingBatch = try supervised.selectingRows([0, 1, 2, 4, 5])","let workflow = try await PCAClassificationWorkflow.train(","    training: trainingBatch,","    components: 2,","    learningRate: 0.125,","    epochs: 64",")","","\/\/ 3. Atomically persist to disk","let fileURL = URL(fileURLWithPath: \"model.json\")","try workflow.save(to: fileURL)","","\/\/ 4. Reload and predict with zero test leakage","let loadedWorkflow = try PCAClassificationWorkflow.load(from: fileURL)","let predictions = try await loadedWorkflow.predict(heldOutBatch.features)"],"type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftworkflow"]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"SwiftWorkflow"}],"roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","title":"SwiftWorkflow","externalID":"SwiftWorkflow","symbolKind":"module"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Production Machine Learning Pipelines, Preprocessing Composition, and Artifact Serialization."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiftWorkflow\/documentation\/SwiftWorkflow"},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://SwiftWorkflow/documentation/SwiftWorkflow/PCAClassificationWorkflow":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PCAClassificationWorkflow","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PCAClassificationWorkflow","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftworkflow\/pcaclassificationworkflow","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A fitted CPU mean-imputation, standardization, PCA and binary logistic workflow."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Published instances expose no mutable stages. Saving never refits or reads prediction data."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftWorkflow\/documentation\/SwiftWorkflow\/PCAClassificationWorkflow","title":"PCAClassificationWorkflow"},"doc://SwiftWorkflow/documentation/SwiftWorkflow/WorkflowPersistence":{"role":"article","type":"topic","kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/swiftworkflow\/workflowpersistence","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Learn how to safely persist, reload, and evaluate end-to-end machine learning workflows across processes."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftWorkflow\/documentation\/SwiftWorkflow\/WorkflowPersistence","title":"Deploying and Persisting Scientific Workflows"},"doc://SwiftWorkflow/documentation/SwiftWorkflow":{"role":"collection","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiftworkflow","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Production Machine Learning Pipelines, Preprocessing Composition, and Artifact Serialization."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftWorkflow\/documentation\/SwiftWorkflow","title":"SwiftWorkflow"}}}